rem Using up to One Million Tiles how
rem Many Different Hollow Square Laminae
rem can be Formed?
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=173
rem Count the hollow square laminae of
rem at most Tiles tiles

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Tiles integer = 1000000

rem Outer side n, hole side m with the
rem same parity: n - m = 2 k, n + m =
rem 2 j with j > k, so tiles = 4 k j.
rem For each k there are Tiles / (4 k)
rem - k choices of j.
Pairs = Tiles // 4
Lim = Pairs isqrt
K = 1 to Lim array
Answer = (Pairs // K - K) sum
Answer print
